[Captain] What is it?

993
00:45:18.847 --> 00:45:20.181
Take a seat, quickly.

994
00:45:20.265 --> 00:45:21.516
Wow, I think I can go.

995
00:45:21.599 --> 00:45:23.393
- [Captain] Team Leader Ahn, what are you doing?
- [Uneasy music]

996
00:45:25.353 --> 00:45:26.855
[Sound of strong wind]

997
00:45:28.815 --> 00:45:30.859
[Rescuer] Just between us
Can't I take you down?

998
00:45:30.942 --> 00:45:32.152
You know it's impossible

999
00:45:34.487 --> 00:45:36.239
[sound of helicopter in the distance]

1000
00:45:41.578 --> 00:45:42.620
Oh! [Rough breathing]

1001
00:45:48.543 --> 00:45:49.711
- [Clicking sound]
- [Crackling sound]

1002
00:45:49.794 --> 00:45:51.254
[Helicopter sounds continuing in the distance]

1003
00:45:57.927 --> 00:45:59.929
[intense music]

1004
00:46:22.994 --> 00:46:23.828
[Captain’s surprised voice]

1005
00:46:25.914 --> 00:46:27.081
[Jaewon’s scared voice]

1006
00:46:34.714 --> 00:46:35.548
Captain

1007
00:46:36.341 --> 00:46:37.675
Let’s touch the baton.

1008
00:46:38.551 --> 00:46:39.385
[Captain] Yes…

1009
00:46:44.307 --> 00:46:45.391
[Jaewon’s heavy breathing]

1010
00:46:47.143 --> 00:46:49.479
We're here, pack your bags and get ready quickly.

1011
00:46:50.063 --> 00:46:51.314
Are they all there? Are they all there?

1012
00:46:52.232 --> 00:46:53.566
[clattering sound of equipment]

1013
00:46:55.652 --> 00:46:57.320
[Jaewon's repeated heavy breathing]

1014
00:46:58.321 --> 00:47:00.615
[Jaewon's scared scream]

1015
00:47:02.116 --> 00:47:04.244
Close it, close it, close it
Close it, quickly.

1016
00:47:04.828 --> 00:47:06.412
[Jaewon continues to sound scared]

1017
00:47:12.460 --> 00:47:13.461
Come quickly!

1018
00:47:13.545 --> 00:47:16.214
I can't, I really can't.
You were on that helicopter.

1019
00:47:16.297 --> 00:47:18.842
Really, really, really, really
I really can't, I can't.

1020
00:47:18.925 --> 00:47:19.759
[Kanghyuk] Hey, anus

1021
00:47:19.843 --> 00:47:21.761
- Would it be like this even if it were your family?
- [Jaewon] No, no, no.

1022
00:47:25.223 --> 00:47:26.599
[groaning sound]

1023
00:47:26.683 --> 00:47:28.768
[Continuous groaning]

1024
00:47:28.852 --> 00:47:31.479
[Jaewon’s scared voice]

1025
00:47:32.939 --> 00:47:34.482
[Jaewon's repeated sounds of surprise]

1026
00:47:34.566 --> 00:47:37.569
Wow, wow, wow, wow!

1027
00:47:37.652 --> 00:47:39.487
no! [Sounds scared again and again]

1028
00:47:41.114 --> 00:47:42.991
Professor, now
You're not going to jump, are you?

1029
00:47:43.074 --> 00:47:44.075
- [Jaewon’s Scream]
- I go first.

1030
00:47:44.158 --> 00:47:45.243
[Jaewon] Please save me!

1031
00:47:45.326 --> 00:47:47.120
-No one!
- [Jungheon] Professor!

1032
00:47:47.203 --> 00:47:48.621
[screaming]

1033
00:47:48.705 --> 00:47:50.415
[The sound echoes distantly]

1034
00:47:51.583 --> 00:47:53.585
[upbeat music]
